      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ICE COLD SAPPORO (1) finished fourth last start, beaten 17 metres at Pinjarra over 2185m. Will enjoy a nice run from this favourable starting position. Won't find this any harder and he can play a major role in the outcome. MY HAMMER DOWN NZ (2) went back last start and didn't measure up when 22 metres from the winner in eighth at Gloucester Park over 2130m. Has failed to fire since he was in the placings at Gloucester Park on October 9. Likely to get all the favours from this nice draw. This is a nice drop in grade so he is sure to prove tough to beat. CHARIVARI (7) has been thereabouts of late and is a great chance to break through. Good effort last time out when he finished fifth at Gloucester Park over 2130m. JIMMY ROCKS (4) is the next elect off a last-start win by 6 metres at Pinjarra over 2185m.",
